38270>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
38271>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
38272>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
38273>>>>>        End
